                                        "entry_id": "911f84c0-db07-33d9-bae3-ad4608df8963",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The instinctive behaviour that protects oneself from harm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80b284ba-a771-41ef-b766-0e40db80b87a",
                                                "sense_id": "19ca4da9-3acf-3ea2-93ca-5bf0f1344c43",
                                                "text": "I'm here to tell you want to do. And if self-preservation is an instinct you possess, you better fuckin' do it and do it quick."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1d0d2b9-df08-4fa0-9310-81b34d4f917b",
                                                "sense_id": "19ca4da9-3acf-3ea2-93ca-5bf0f1344c43",
                                                "text": "Yet had the whole train and all its bombs gone, had the engine crew merely jumped from the train and run as simple self-preservation would have suggested, or unhitched just the engine to make their escape faster, the whole town would have gone and most of the people with it, leaving just a smoking wasteland. Hundreds would have died."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
